---
description: Python conventions for free-model-gateway
globs: "**/*.py"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Prefer stdlib + pyyaml/jinja2/requests for core library code.
- Keep registry logic pure and unit-testable (inject nvidia-smi output).
- Raise clear RuntimeError / ValueError with actionable messages.
- Do not add databases, Redis, or always-on services in MVP.
